WEBVTT

NOTE
Design notes for the Usher demo reel, shown as a subtitles track so the captions
button, the captions menu and the caption lift can be tried.

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Near white. No bar and no glass: white print
over a soft scrim that keeps the picture's texture.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Over pure white the scrim still holds
white print at 5.7:1.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Near black. The same scrim disappears into the dark.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.500
The marker holds the current time,
so the button row never makes room for a number.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.500
Press G and type a time, such as 0:50, to go straight there.

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.500
Drag the line: the marker lifts, grows
and names the chapter under your pointer.

7
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.500
Every control is reachable by keyboard,
and keyboard focus keeps the controls on screen.
